		<pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2014 02:00:48 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1090#comment-32380</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Your ability to be present and wholly engaged is such a gift.  My last camp experience with you was of receiving a welcome hug that fully surrounded my inner and outer being.  Thanks for your camping spot that year, Tom Ayaz.  We both seemed to think a spot that was between the yurt and the Mother Mary statue was &quot;prime real estate&quot;.  May you continue to blow your conch on your new journey.

Peace and Love]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Your ability to be present and wholly engaged is such a gift.  My last camp experience with you was of receiving a welcome hug that fully surrounded my inner and outer being.  Thanks for your camping spot that year, Tom Ayaz.  We both seemed to think a spot that was between the yurt and the Mother Mary statue was &#8220;prime real estate&#8221;.  May you continue to blow your conch on your new journey.</p>
<p>Peace and Love</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
